# Baseline: vLLM defaults except the two memory flags below (docs/02-architecture.md,
# "Serving layer"). Prefix caching stays on, as in a stock deployment;
# engine/no-prefix-cache.env is experiment B1.
#
# --max-num-seqs and --max-num-batched-tokens are the defaults vLLM 0.29.0
# resolves on a 32 GB card (vllm/engine/arg_utils.py, "other hardware"), set
# explicitly anyway: the startup log and /metrics never show resolved
# defaults, and the recorded argv has to say what the scheduler ran with.
ENGINE_ARGS=--gpu-memory-utilization 0.90 --max-model-len 8192 --max-num-seqs 256 --max-num-batched-tokens 2048
